I don't know exactly how prayer benefits are handled but know they
depend on luck. That's why you need high luck to get crowned. I also
know that getting protection is more likely with low luck. So keep
your luck high, I guess. Somebody else will know better than I do.

If you truly need more spellbooks, you can get fresh spellbooks by
canceling and polypiling your spares. As long as you alternate
cancellation and polymorphing, you should churn out fresh books. Oh,
and wizards can write any spellbook with 98% success with maxed luck,
so it's easier to write the cheap ones.


